Program: exec1sql.py, ver. 2024-12-16
Author:  V.Zerkin, v.zerkin@gmail.com, Vienna, 2024
Purpose: execute one SQL command on SQLite database.
Operations:
         - connect to SQLite data file;
         - execute SQL command;
         - read retrieved data rows to list of dicts
           extracting data (incl.JSON) from row to dict;
         - save result in JSON file and CSV file for EXCEL.

Running: 2024-12-17 13:23:08

---getConnSQLite: file:../../x4sqlite1.db?mode=ro

---SQL:SELECT distinct x4pro_c5dat.DatasetID,REACODE.FullCode
FROM x4pro_c5dat 
inner join REACODE on REACODE.ReacodeID=x4pro_c5dat.DatasetID
where fullCode like '%,PTY' and y=0

